/P 190 0 R
/E (We used the Solidworks Finite Element Analysis to perform stress testing on crucial points of our robot. One such point was our hanging hook, which holds the mass of our robot during endgame. We replicated the hanging scenario to determine the need for reinforcements. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [14 15]
>>
