300 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 191 0 R
/E (To track and maintain the position of our robot during the autonomous period, we use 2 odometer pods and the in-built Control Hub gyroscope to maintain our X, Y, and heading positions. Motion profiles accurately control our velocity through each movement while applying PID-based position control to account for any error accumulated during trajectories. Additionally, we apply principles from our open-sourced pathing algorithm, BeepBeep, which uses Bezier curves to make smooth, continuous paths around the field. This accurate movement allows us to travel with precision at high speed.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9 10 11]
>>
endobj
