313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 192 0 R
/E (Our current mechanism merges two subsystems for a streamlined intake. A dual servo-controlled arm with flexible TPU flaps matches the height of pixels in a stack. Using two rows of surgical tubing, pixels are pulled up a thin steel ramp into a conveyor belt system. The movement of belts provides a uniform force that pushes pixels into the correct orientation against a set of aligners. Two color sensors detect the presence of pixels once they are ready to be collected by the deposit.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10 11]
>>
endobj
