/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 195 0 R
/E (Using 4 points, we produce a Bezier curve that forms our path. The length of the curve is calculated using calculus and is then broken down into equally spaced points. Using position-based PID and velocity-based feedforward control, our robot tightly follows the curve.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
endobj
