/P 195 0 R
/E (The restrictive nature of current FTC autonomous movement libraries pushed us to develop BeepBeep: a custom path planning and motion profiling system that breaks down Bezier curves into a set of fluid motions for a robot to follow. Our library uses position and velocity-based correction to ensure the robot can tightly follow its path. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11 12]
>>
