424 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E (To foster FIRST education irrespective of background or location, we developed a 106-video FTC Crash Course series, covering a diverse set of topics, including fundamental programming, 3D design, managing finances, and FIRST values. Through this effort, we created and are mentoring 11 FTC teams, 16 FLL teams, and 9 FLL chapters of the Silicon Valley Boys and Girls Club. Our series has accumulated over 80,000 views and 790 subscribers.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [13 14]
>>
