/Pg 19 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
438 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (Wanting to bring direct and accessible research opportunities for girls interested in STEM, we worked with Stanford University to host four international workshops. Female researchers at the Stanford National Accelerator Laboratory, specializing in various STEM fields from astrophysics to engineering, presented to 371 students. Students collaborated with the professors to develop research projects and present their findings.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [12 13]
>>
endobj
