/T (Our team's dedication to innovation and community impact drives us to make responsible decisions and maintain a strong team structure. With proactive members, FIRST alumni, and local outreach connections, we aim to overcome challenges like team coordination. Our partnership with Hack Bank enhances our financial stability, empowering us to explore industrial solutions and expand robotics programs, reflecting our commitment to positive change and resilience.)
