473 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 201 0 R
/T (Our school-affiliated financial account limited opportunities to raise and access funds. Hence, we formed a partnership with Hack Bank, founding our own fiscal non-profit through which we manage expenses and fundraising. Our non-profit status verified our credibility within our community, resulting in multiple new partnerships with companies like Lockheed Martin and Apple, bringing us $5000 in sponsorships, grants, and donations. Managing our funds under Hack Bank taught members responsible and sustainable money management skills for the future.)
